<title>UK: Adelaide Bank sets $200 mln three-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Adelaide Bank sets $200 mln three-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ADELAIDE BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    31.JUL.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +1/8	PAY DATE    31.JUL.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY BAA3	ISS PRICE  99.915    FULL FEES   0.15</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   BBB	 REOFFER    99.915</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRALIA TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
